         seen an MVC installation has no GAC copy: the published folder is the only
         place IIS can find them. "Could not load file or assembly 'System.Web.WebPages'"
         is the 500 that follows if it cannot. -->
    <Reference Include="System.Web.WebPages">
      <HintPath>..\..\..\T5Web [3.5.7]\App\bin\System.Web.WebPages.dll</HintPath>
      <Private>true</Private>
    </Reference>
